<title>USA: TABLE - First Financial Q2 net, share up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - First Financial Q2 net, share up.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Ohio 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.67		    $0.61</p>
<p> Net		 10,014		   9,045</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  15,039		   14,725</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.29		    $1.16</p>
<p> Net		 19,428		   16,871</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  15,035		   14,523</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q2 97 net interest income was $28.5 million vs $25.2 million in Q2 96.</p>
<p>All per share data before September 30, 1996 restated for a 10 percent stock dividend declared September 24, 1996. EPS also continues to be directly affected by pooling of interest accounting used in 1996 and 1997 acquisitions in which, due to size of the deals, it was not necessary to restate the holding co's financial data.</p>
<p>Full co name is First Financial Bancorp.</p>
